 l do his/her best to keep the group together with occasional regroupings a
 nd/or splitting into multiple groups to align to pace capabilities.\n\nPle
 ase do not join this ride if you are not willing to ride with the group. I
 f you exceed the posted pace\, you will be riding by yourself and encourag
 ed to join a faster group. If maintaining a 12-14 mph average is beyond yo
 ur current ability level\, please consider joining a slower ride first.\n\
