SUMMARY:Impromptu: LC Landis Valley Ride (18R) (11-12mph)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nThis is a "fun" ride no o
 ne will be left behind. Re-grouping stops as needed.\n\nRide leader: Jon H
 artung\nSweep: Heather Soistmann\n\nAnticipated Average Pace: 11-12 mph\n\
 nRoute: [LC Landis Valley Ride (18R)](https://routes.lancasterbikeclub.net
 /cue/lc-landis-valley-ride-18r/)\n[Lancaster Bike Club](https://routes.lan
 casterbikeclub.net/cue/lc-landis-valley-ride-18r/)[https://routes.lancaste
 rbikeclub.net/cue/lc-landis-valley-ride-18r/](https://routes.lancasterbike
 club.net/cue/lc-landis-valley-ride-18r/)\n\nThe ride leader will ride at t
 he advertised average speed. This is intended to be a group ride with a no
 -drop rule as the main goal. The ride leader will do his/her best to keep 
 the group together with occasional regroupings and a sweeper may also be a
 ppointed at the start. Please do not join this ride if you are not willing
  to ride with the group. If you exceed the posted pace\, you will be ridin
 g by yourself and encouraged to join a faster group.\n\nIf maintaining a 1
 1-12 mph average is beyond your current ability level\, please consider jo
 ining a slower ride first.\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No earbuds. Please br
 ing water and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 infl
 ator).\n\nTo eliminate passing around a pen and paper waiver\, we require 
 LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below to join this ride. Being on Meet
 up does not mean you are a club member.\n\nJoin @ Lancasterbikeclub.net -M
 ember Signup. Your RSVP is your agreement to abide by the club's Code of C
 onduct: Code of Conduct Guidance if an incident occurs: Incident Actions
