SUMMARY:CoffeeTue- LV Lititz Chocolate Ride (23R) C/D Pace-- RSVP required
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nRide Leader: (volunteer t
 o lead!)\nRide Sweep: Rick Zook\n\nCoffeeTue rides:\n• A rotating start 
 location\, not a school\n• A predetermined route\n• 25+/- mile routes\
 n• 12 to 14 and 14 to 17 mph average pace\n• “short” stop for refr
 eshment/coffee mid-route at [New Holland Coffee](https://www.newhollandcof
 fee.com/) (Lititz location) or one of the other Lititz coffee shops\n\nLik
 e an All Class Ride\, CoffeeTue does not have a single pace.\nAs Sweep\, R
 ick Zook will bike with any "D" ride cyclist.\nThe CoffeeTue rides are soc
 ial rides\, but cyclists are not expected to stay in one group. Cyclists m
 ay pedal at their own comfortable paces. A planned stop to regroup is reco
 mmended. Please be supportive of the other cyclists to avoid anyone biking
  alone or being dropped off the back of the last group.\n**Be Safe\, Have 
 Fun\, and Ride Together**\n\nClick for [Ride with GPS](https://routes.lanc
 asterbikeclub.net/cue/lv-lititz-chocolate-ride-23r/)\n\nHelmets are mandat
 ory. No ear buds. Please bring water and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, 
 tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nTo eliminate passing around a pen and
  paper waiver\, we require LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below to jo
 in this ride.\n\nBeing on Meetup does not mean you are a club member. [Joi
 n here](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=
 257148).\n\nYour RSVP is your agreement to abide by the club's [Code of Co
 nduct](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_i
 d=257148&module_id=323984) \,\n[Rules of the Road](https://lancbikeclub.cl
 ubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=325159) \, 
 and [Ride Waiver](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/docs.ashx?id=454318)\nIn c
 ase of accident\, consult the [Ride Leader Guide](https://s3.amazonaws.com
 /ClubExpressClubFiles/257148/documents/Ride_Leader_Guide_2026_123357428.pd
 f?AWSAccessKeyId=AKIA6MYUE6DNNJ6ROIH3&Expires=1778249903&response-content-
 disposition=inline%3B%20filename%3DRide_Leader_Guide_2026.pdf&Signature=pw
 xGJ6nqlu4w9Zj8Kj%2Fl9U5%2BBtQ%3D).
